# The print agent runs on the kiosk PC. It talks to a USB thermal printer and
# binds 127.0.0.1 — there is nothing it could usefully do in a serverless
# function, and PHOTO_MODULE.md rule 2 says image handling never leaves the
# device. Excluding it from the upload makes that structural rather than a
# convention someone has to remember.
